summary: Basic devel usability test
description: |
    Verify that a C program can be compiled and linked against libseccomp-devel
    using distribution-specific build flags, and that the resulting binary runs
    successfully and retrieves the libseccomp version.
contact: Patrik Koncity <pkoncity@redhat.com>
test: ./runtest.sh
duration: 5m
enabled: true
require:
  - gcc
  - rpm
  - redhat-rpm-config
  - pkgconf-pkg-config
  - libseccomp-devel
tag:
  - CI-Tier-1
  - ImageMode
id: e31c2ad0-ed08-4e36-adb0-a759191f3a6a
